{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0bf0603e3b037b78f0cf88be10b06087c6cfc16cf2d55daab41976a95e82b167", "ja": "（真に、新しい仕事の依頼がきた。\nしかしこの内容……真が喜びそうな気がするな！）", "zh": "（真接到了一份新的工作邀请。不过这个内容……感觉真一定会很开心！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0ad3156f493090facdfe7d3e72fdbf39df06ed73ac3b87b29b19926cbe0fea7d", "ja": "（センター公演の準備も同時進行だし、\n急いで本人に伝えないと……さて、真はどこだ？）", "zh": "中心公演的准备也在同时进行，得赶紧告诉本人……真现在在哪儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "7170ea2f40c32b99925575247ba23bfffedb66332e133cc8d21b6ed423a238cb", "ja": "そうなんだよ！　ボクも、カケルのあのセリフが気に\nなっちゃって。単行本、1巻から読み直してみたんだ。", "zh": "就是啊！我也很在意小翔的那句台词，就从单行本第1卷开始重新看了一遍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "ebc231481f763a925d0cac85a3aa3b56359db8798432e4b2d8cd59c13c81ca8b", "ja": "そしたら、2巻で言ってたんだよ……流れ星のこと！\nあれ、もしかしなくても伏線だったのかなって……。", "zh": "结果在第2卷里就提到过……流星的事！\n难道那就是伏笔吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "28ce9031307c32bae2e3194741c2b0a8f9a44b11f9368ed18011a5e126d59373", "ja": "ええっ、そうなんですか！？\n……ねえねえ、まつりちゃん！", "zh": "咦，是这样吗！？\n……对了对了，茉莉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "10db9f92518bfae212f268b49380cb5e88abca519e8ad5ce95fe9d9f167e7938", "ja": "ふふっ……姫はお見通しなのですよ、未来ちゃん。\n『キミさけ』全巻、今度持ってきてあげるのです！", "zh": "呵呵……公主早就看穿一切了哦，未来。\n下次把《キミさけ》全集带来给你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "b461cfcbbcf20355aabfe9b83f539fb336b3e22fa7340cb5a8edd18864801504", "ja": "やったー！　ありがとう、まつりちゃん♪", "zh": "太好了！谢谢你，茉莉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "83315dd11aa912369853a7760a3ef726bccbc5e8ea401333e757d891711aa186", "ja": "『キミさけ』仲間ができるのは、姫も大歓迎なのです！\nね、真ちゃん？", "zh": "能有一起喜欢《キミさけ》的同好，公主也非常欢迎哦！\n对吧，真？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "cbcc2c8a3a01662e034dda2090f9e0f1a20ec4134e59bd327fc6eac451f94d54", "ja": "うん！　ボクも、『キミさけ』はすごくステキな\n漫画だから、たくさんの人に読んでほしいと思うんだ！", "zh": "嗯！我也觉得《キミさけ》是非常棒的漫画，希望能让更多人读到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "58464aab4131755dd0075778e0a0988cf878f31f1f016d407c0f56f15e71046d", "ja": "ところで、ふたりは王子様なハルト君と\n硬派なカケル君、どっちがタイプなのです？", "zh": "话说回来，对于王子般的春斗和硬派的翔君，你们更喜欢哪一型呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "59246a2842fc95525e06841f9961e79ee6d31f147bf2e5d72a04eb6637b38c36", "ja": "えーっ！？\nまつりちゃん、それ、選ばないとダメなの？", "zh": "诶——！？\n小祭，那是必须选一个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "ad3809837bc1527387a38621802c877e557123d0418e20f44c04b0fa34236546", "ja": "ダメなのです！", "zh": "不行的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "754b31efb771b21033d950a14b9d663057b322e4e5d3536db0234ba9b5a7d999", "ja": "えっと、えっと……\n真さんは、どっちですか！？", "zh": "那个，那个……\n真，你选哪一个！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "e2fd027bbc90c787c829507804f111b3126093db6b4f0e2ca49f2a06634abcd7", "ja": "ボク？　ボクは……やっぱり、ハルトかな？\n優しいし、主人公のことをよく見てくれてるし……。", "zh": "我？我果然还是选春斗吧？\n因为他很温柔，也一直很关注主角……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "3a85ac7ce1e3bf4e39a317bfaf27b3231fb7e5d6fed2bc74e8043bbbab56ec3e", "ja": "あっ、でもカケルも素直じゃないだけで、根はすごく\nいいやつなんだよね……ううっ、迷っちゃうな～！", "zh": "啊，不过阿翔也只是嘴硬，其实本性也是个非常好的人呢……呜呜，好纠结啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1015_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bb52d4ef9e207d470a5f37cd261247378190675e239a2266e3b76bf5392f1c59", "ja": "真、ここにいたんだな。未来、まつりもお疲れさま！\nなんだか賑やかだけど、何の話をしてたんだ？", "zh": "真，原来你在这里啊。未来、茉莉，你们也辛苦了！\n感觉很热闹嘛，你们刚才在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "14168041b2e87786d3be93ba592dad72202836331bdcbe80ad6f6e76ef9cbab1", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n今、みんなで『キミさけ』の話をしてたんですよ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我们刚才正在一起聊《キミさけ》的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1018_p", "source_sha256": "894271baa5eba2c7c3014b518bfe0d3b94855b0038d1f74a8d02999d159b5c24", "ja": "キミさけ？　……っていうのは？", "zh": "キミさけ？……是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "9317be402f9bac61db3480a77142acb02a5ac8e1e476411a2912443555d9f0b2", "ja": "し、知らないんですか！？\n『りるきゃん』で、一番の話題作なんですよ！？", "zh": "您、您不知道吗！？\n这可是《Little Candy》中最热门的话题作品啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "e18704efa27e6ec61418c6bd1f8a5c2e8ffb536551ae459e536e5d81e33962e1", "ja": "そうなのです、姫のイチオシ漫画なのですよ！　なのに\n読んでないなんて、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "没错，这是本公主最推荐的漫画哦！可你居然没读过，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1024_p", "source_sha256": "136713c6b4053369ff3335b9525f6d065595dfdb98f8f45591269e8bcc0a12e5", "ja": "す、すまない、そんなに人気なのか……。\n後でチェックしておくよ！", "zh": "抱、抱歉，原来那么受欢迎啊……\n我之后会去看看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5355b9e6b5c5d7cae4f4fa4f3f4e51c0e98e1e3b8c971b121f99adc6f3e7f19f", "ja": "それより、真に仕事の話があってきたんだ。", "zh": "比起这个，我是有工作上的事来找真商量的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "6cfe01c4ce772ab4ced3cf875e4efe8fe219ec9c78ed3504aef62ac8d1ed7d20", "ja": "えっ、ボクにですか？", "zh": "诶，是找我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1027_p", "source_sha256": "dfb0ae63f5e25d11d81b3f62af27e71bfad3184ec4756bd3d1ece784f4dbb43d", "ja": "真、『Whitelilac』って雑誌を知ってるか？\n『りるきゃん』と同じ出版社が出してるんだけど……。", "zh": "真，你知道一本叫《Whitelilac》的杂志吗？\n是和《りるきゃん》由同一家出版社发行的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "6c683571805a233e20d2ab6a16744f080163c5aa7d325f41ad9363c1abc467de", "ja": "もちろん、知ってますよ！　表紙も中身のページも、\nぜーんぶがカワイイ成分でできてる雑誌ですよね！", "zh": "当然知道了！从封面到里面的内页，\n全都充满了可爱的成分，就是那本杂志对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "0e0e7d65311698828e48fbe5a40ea83a6dc851035b19a9e413fa92e7cbae9274", "ja": "白いドレスに白い花の冠……幻想的な森の奥に、\nひっそりと隠れるように住んでいる女の子……。", "zh": "白色礼裙配上白色花冠……住在梦幻森林深处、仿佛悄悄隐藏起来的女孩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "baf0c544f02538786add99f7c8d5f7f8ef0db1b83ad9cef3a58dfaa9bca6a0a8", "ja": "くぅ～、いいなぁ……♪\nボクも一度でいいから、あんな格好してみたいなぁ～！", "zh": "呜～真好啊……♪\n我也想哪怕一次，试试那样的打扮啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1031_p", "source_sha256": "2ed1a83fb37d472aa76e77d2f0221fffd6e3847435acff754a565cd5ecf1df3a", "ja": "うん、それなら良かった！\n今回の仕事は、その雑誌のモデルだ！", "zh": "嗯，那就太好了！\n这次的工作就是当那本杂志的模特！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3a827102d5e59afa56a8a3efe8003c24e4ef87d24302c8d4801af801b2d823c1", "ja": "衣装は『Whitelilac』らしい、白い\nワンピース。妖精をイメージした撮影になるそうだ。", "zh": "听说服装是《Whitelilac》风格的白色连衣裙。好像会以妖精为主题进行拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "78df0be98726a810d32e5cf26e62228daf359c7c2998c6635f4e4eb874ba12e2", "ja": "ええっ！？　ぼ、ボクが、妖精ですか！？\nしかも……白いワンピースの！", "zh": "诶！？我、我来演精灵吗！？\n而且……还是穿白色连衣裙的精灵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1034_006mak", "source_sha256": "059f02ed7857dd39e99ffa44b13fed25d62167ccb780d1f02149a912e1820095", "ja": "{$P$}、本当にボクですか！？\nあとで「間違いだった」とか言わないですよね！？", "zh": "{$P$}，真的是我吗！？\n之后不会又说“搞错了”吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1035_p", "source_sha256": "be5c053000840b80a15fbcb370fcbe581bc2ff83e6a5f5e4d3cfbfd429ddf089", "ja": "大丈夫だ、真で間違いない。\n良かったな、真！", "zh": "没问题，确实是真没错。\n太好了，真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1036_021mat", "source_sha256": "47216deebd2584c12b3633c657dec86c4d693ba437744796fcdcc67a66d1a44a", "ja": "わんだほー！\nよかったですね、真ちゃん♪", "zh": "太棒啦！太好了呢，小真♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c336ae1b1c7b59bbd69ad64a2c2ad3a27e1f731868be12995045a9d5cfa3588", "ja": "真さん、おめでとうございます！\nいいなぁ、妖精さん役！　なんだか楽しそう♪", "zh": "真，恭喜你！\n演妖精，好羡慕啊！感觉一定很有意思♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "fef1909dd4be1108c2374369ed9ba6702858b6a4ca7088c3bdb4bbe1208d72b3", "ja": "ありがとう、ふたりとも！　『Whitelilac』\nの撮影かぁ……どんな感じなんだろう？", "zh": "谢谢你们两个！“Whitelilac”\n的拍摄啊……会是什么样的感觉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f26a06397b0bca46c4356234b2dde498f28e0ce3bab2b83b6084e43ff2df8f69", "ja": "この前も言ったけど、真はセンター公演も控えてる。\n忙しくなるけど、公演も話題になるように頑張ろうな！", "zh": "之前也说过了，真还要准备Center公演。虽然会变得很忙，但为了让公演也成为话题，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1040_006mak", "source_sha256": "4580011f25078d8c45252bd42fd1c9f712dd9db475d4c81d2420c5ec243f6d12", "ja": "はい、まかせてください！　ボクのセンター公演には、\n未来とまつりも出てくれるんだよね？", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！未来和茉莉也会参加我的中心公演，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "3879139ef6305ce8f4486dc53672e65bd46c778ce3dec4ec97d8cb84b4733e39", "ja": "そうなのです。未来ちゃんと一緒に、\n真ちゃんをサポートするのです♪", "zh": "就是这样。我要和未来一起，支持真呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "6781070c4dd7f6bb76e5e8790946d7fdb92d01caf51df92eefa15704c371aecf", "ja": "はいっ！　私も、がんばりまーす！", "zh": "好的！我也会加油的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1043_006mak", "source_sha256": "629fc63585acf313255108bbf6337ccccb30519a431cbbf8d6285560337c018b", "ja": "ふたりがいるなら、心強いね！　ボクも負けないよう、\nジャンジャンバリバリ気合い入れていくぞ～！", "zh": "有你们两个在，真让人安心！我也不能输给你们，要干劲十足地全力上啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_061_1044_p", "source_sha256": "9dc8dc6ab20a4bbabbf366a578739645f12b520145ada665da5cd30205d8db0e", "ja": "（みんな、気合いが入ってるな！\n真の、劇場初センター公演……楽しみが増えたな！）", "zh": "（大家都干劲十足啊！真在剧场首次担任中心的公演……让人更加期待了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
